/// The thirteen states of one admission attempt.
///
/// Previously a free `String` with a comment listing the values, which the
/// workflow engine validated on transition but nothing stopped a direct write
/// of `"aproved"` from bypassing.
///
/// `APPROVED` means **"offer made, seat provisionally held"** — it is no longer
/// terminal. `ADMITTED` is the terminal state, reached only through `admit()`,
/// and it is the state in which a Student, Admission and first Enrollment exist.
///
/// See docs/planning/student-admission-enrollment-architecture.md §17.
enum AdmissionApplicationStatus {
  DRAFT
  SUBMITTED
  UNDER_REVIEW
  DOCUMENT_PENDING
  FEE_PENDING
  WAITLISTED
  APPROVED
  SEAT_CONFIRMED
  DEFERRED
  ADMITTED
  REJECTED
  WITHDRAWN
  CANCELLED
}
